course: dictionary
lesson: 9903
title: Words for people who talk
level: primary-4
stars: 0
explain: A talker is a person who talks. The words around talker tell you which kind of talker is meant, so read the whole sentence before you choose a meaning.
explain: «Toad sulks for a moment, then admits he is a bit of a talker.» Here talker means someone who chats a lot. The words a bit of show that this is a small, friendly fact about Toad, not a big problem.
explain: A talker can also be someone who talks about doing things but never does them. «He's all talk» means the same idea. Ask yourself: is the sentence about chatting, charm, or promises that are never kept?
fact: A talker is a person who talks.
fact: Informally, a talker is someone who talks a lot.
fact: A «smooth talker» is someone who persuades people, sometimes to trick them.
fact: Someone who talks about doing things but does not do them is «all talk».
fact: Useful phrases are «a good talker», «a big talker», «a smooth talker» and «a fast talker».
exercise: Toad admits he is «a bit of a talker». What does talker mean here? | Someone who cooks very well | Someone who runs very fast | *Someone who chats a lot | Someone who sleeps all day
exercise: What is a «smooth talker»? | Someone who never speaks at all | *Someone who persuades people, sometimes to trick them | Someone who sings beautifully on stage | Someone who writes long letters to friends
exercise: Ben says he will help tidy up, but he never does. What does «he's all talk» mean? | He always tells the whole truth | He talks very loudly at the seaside | *He talks about doing things but does not do them | He can talk to animals
test: A teacher tells Mia she is «a real talker». What is the teacher most likely saying? | *Mia chats a lot and should listen more | Mia has never spoken in class | Mia is lost for words | Mia has a beautiful singing voice
test: Which phrase means someone who is very good at speaking? | a loud drum | *a good talker | a dark cupboard | a quiet corner
exam: Choose the best phrase: «The salesman was ___, and he talked everyone into buying a broken bike.» | a quiet reader | *a smooth talker | a kind gardener | a tall tree
